{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"850779383656218636","content":"I had jsut re-read both (the constitution and the wardens agreement) and it seemed that it would work, and itll be preserved.  The only weird part is, citizenship of the people that call it home, partially or fully.... So those players will have to pick which citizenship they will have, since we have no allowance of dual citizenship.  But that in of itself becomes an interesting roleply opportunity for the next couple days/epilogues","created_at":"2021-08-25T16:02:22.691000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880119928076763136","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
